Journey: Mobile shop login
Platform: android
App: "com.shop.app"
Device: Pixel 8 (Android 15)
Tags: @mobile @smoke

Type "alice" into the Username field
  Expect the Username field has value "alice"
Tap the "Log in" button
  Expect an alert saying "Signed in as alice"
Accept the system alert
Expect the screen to contain "ORD-"
Capture the text of the "ORD-1001 Shipped" item as firstOrder
  Expect the "ORD-1001 Shipped" item contains "ORD-1001"
Swipe up until "ORD-1002 Pending" is visible
Rotate to landscape
Rotate to portrait
